<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Arial, sans-serif;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f0f0f0; padding:30px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#1a4d2e; padding:36px 40px; text-align:center;">
              <div style="font-size:42px; line-height:1; margin-bottom:12px;">🛏️</div>
              <h1 style="color:#ffffff; margin:0 0 8px; font-size:26px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px;">
                No Full-Week Beds Left
              </h1>
              <p style="color:#a8d5b5; margin:0; font-size:15px;">
                KPC <%= @trip.number %> &bull; <%= @trip.location %> &bull; <%= @trip.year %>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 40px;">

              <p style="color:#333333; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 20px; line-height:1.5;">
                Hey <strong><%= @admin.nickname %></strong>,
                <% if @any_open %>
                  <strong>no bed is open for the full week anymore</strong> (<%= @registered_count %> golfers registered), but some nights still have room: <%= @open_by_night.select { |_n, o| o > 0 }.map { |n, o| "#{n.date.strftime('%a %-m/%-d')} (#{o})" }.join(', ') %>.
                <% else %>
                  the house just filled up: <strong>every night is at capacity</strong> with <%= @registered_count %> golfers registered.
                <% end %>
              </p>
              <p style="color:#333333; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 28px; line-height:1.5;">
                <%= @recipient_count %> <%= 'golfer'.pluralize(@recipient_count) %> haven't registered yet and will keep getting the "house is full" email, so sign-ups may continue. Registration is blocked on full nights, so anyone who wants a full week now needs a second house. Time to decide whether to book one. Beds also reopen if someone drops out or cuts their trip short.
              </p>

              <!-- CTA -->
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 auto 8px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background-color:#1a4d2e; border-radius:6px;">
                    <a href="<%= @bed_assignments_url %>" style="display:inline-block; padding:14px 32px; color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;">
                      View Bed Assignments
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#f5faf7; padding:20px 40px; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #ddeee4;">
              <p style="color:#aaaaaa; font-size:12px; margin:0;">
                Kitchen Pass Classic &bull; Committee notice
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
